Package: fishmetaweb
Type: Package
Title: Predicted Trophic Interactions Among Ray-Finned Fishes
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("G. Virginio", "Clemente", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "g.v.clemente@outlook.it"),
    person("John", "Llewelyn", role = "aut"),
    person("Corey J. A.", "Bradshaw", role = "aut"),
    person("Valeriano", "Parravicini", role = "aut"),
    person("Giovanni", "Strona", role = "aut"))
Description: A fitted random-forest model of prey-predator interactions among
    ray-finned fishes, together with the trait and phylogenetic data it needs.
    The package returns the predicted probability that one species feeds on
    another, and assembles a food web for any list of species by keeping the
    predicted links whose two endpoints both occur in the list. The model is
    shipped fitted; nothing is estimated at run time.
